00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,601
Here is the puzzle.

2
00:00:01,601 --> 00:00:06,861
Ether, ethoxyethane, has the formula C four H ten O.

3
00:00:06,861 --> 00:00:08,606
So does butan one ol.

4
00:00:08,606 --> 00:00:10,625
Same atoms, same mass.

5
00:00:10,625 --> 00:00:19,375
Yet the ether boils at thirty four point six degrees, it evaporates from your palm, while the alcohol boils at one hundred and seventeen.

6
00:00:19,375 --> 00:00:21,731
A gap of eighty three degrees.

